What is a Mobile POS System?

A Mobile POS (Point of Sale) System refers to the transformation of smartphones, tablets, or dedicated wireless devices into fully functional electronic cash registers. This technological evolution represents a significant advancement beyond traditional fixed-location terminals, offering unprecedented flexibility in payment processing.

